<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities raised its share earnings estimates on Intel Corp for 1996 to $5.70 from $5.50 and 1997's to $8.85 from $7.40, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 136-7/8 Wednesday.</p>
</text>
